<title>USA: Hutchinson Technology to expand facility.</title>
<headline>Hutchinson Technology to expand facility.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Technology Inc said Tuseday that it will add 150,000 square feet of new manufacturing and office space on its Hutchinson, Minn. headquarters campus by expanding an existing building.</p>
<p>Construction is expected to begin in mid-June and to be completed by March 1998.  Construction costs for the expansion are currently estimated to total $12 million to $15 million.</p>
<p>Hutchinson Technology supplies suspension assemblies for disk drives.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
